+    // The measured spacing pools (12 pt, 3.09 pt spacing; scaled with the
+    // spacing): a CJK unit with 1/2/3/4/5/6/8 spacings elsewhere on the
+    // line fits 1.55/2.75/3.15/3.45/3.55/3.75/3.75 pt over without spots, a
+    // Latin unit's own spacing gives half a spacing and the others
