+        // to the Latin spaces first, up to about 2.5 pt each (5/6 of a
+        // space), and to the automatic CJK-Latin spacings, up to a whole
+        // spacing each; after that every slot on the line grows together —
+        // the CJK gaps, full-width punctuation, the spaces and spacings
